   145	| The checker found an alethic violation | verdicts on the checker channel, state `ran` | 1 | REPORT IT — the document describes a world that violates the model |
   146	| The population is vacuous | state `ran` | 2 | report it; a document that supports no facts is a finding |
   147	| The checker could not decide | state `ran` | 4 | report it |
   148	| Everything held | state `ran` | 0 | report it |
